, "upanisad": 5, "bauddha": 5, "brahmana": 5, "rgveda": 5, "atharva": 5, "yajus": 5}}, "era": {"counts": {"Classical": 194, "Sutra-Sastra": 680, "Epic-Purana": 311, "Brahmana-Upanisad": 1228, "Vedic": 2354}, "band": {"Classical": 5, "Sutra-Sastra": 5, "Epic-Purana": 5, "Brahmana-Upanisad": 5, "Vedic": 5}}}, "en": "<div n=\"p\">— <ab>desid.</ab>\n<div n=\"1\"> 1) {#di/Dizati#} to wish to give, to wish to procure: {#de\\vAya^ de\\vIrdi^Diza\\ntyanna^m#}\n<ls>ṚV. 2,35,5.</ls> {#pra\\jAva^da\\sme di^Dizantu\\ ratna^m#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">3,8,6.</ls> to wish to endow, to wish to present with: {#saM sAnu\\ mArjmi\\ diDi^zAmi\\ bilmE^H#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">2,35,12.</ls> {#indre^Ra mi\\traM di^Dizema gI\\rBiH#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">8,85,6.</ls> <ab>med.</ab> to wish to procure for oneself, to seek to obtain: {#indra^ o\\kya^M diDizanta DI\\taya^H#}\n<ls>ṚV. 1,132,5.</ls> {#pa\\rAvato\\ ye diDi^zanta\\ Apya^m#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">10,63,1.</ls> {#aDA^ ci\\nnu yaddiDi^zAmahe vAmA\\Ba pri\\yaM rekRa\\H patya^mAnAH#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV. 10,\">132,3.</ls> {#di\\vaH payo\\ diDi^zARA avezan (devAH)#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV. 10,\">114,1.</ls> {#sto\\tAra\\middi^Dizeya#} I would seek to obtain or I would wish to present with\n<ls n=\"ṚV. 10,114,\">7.</ls> <ls n=\"ṚV. 10,\">32,18.</ls> to wish to raise: {#indra^syAva\\dyaM di^Dizanta Apa^H#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">4,18,7.</ls> <ab>Vgl.</ab> {#diDizAyya, diDizu#} ."}
