{"key1": "DA", "subcard": "_d_a~~h0_50_ni_0", "iast": "nidhā", "h": "nidhā (part 1/2)", "sense_tag": "3", "ru": "<div n=\"1\">— 3) {%откладывать на хранение%} или {%чтобы скрыть; передавать, вверять, дарить%}: {#a\\raRyornihi^to jA\\tave^dAH#}\n<ls>ṚV. 3,29,2.</ls> {#ni\\DI\\yamA^na\\mapa^gU|ama\\psu#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">10,32,6.</ls> {#Ba\\drEzA^M la\\kzmIrnihi\\tADi^ vA\\ci#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV. 10,\">71,2.</ls> {#guhA^ ni\\DI nihi^tO\\ brAhma^Rasya#}\n<ls>AV. 11,5,10.</ls> {#ni me^ Dehi\\ ni te^ daDe#}\n<ls>VS. 3,50.</ls> {#pu\\rURi\\ ratnA\\ daDa^tO\\ nya1^\\sme#}\n<ls>ṚV. 7,70,4.</ls> {#a\\nyasmi^nyU\\Te ni da^DAti\\ reta^H#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">3,55,17.</ls> {#ye tvA\\yA ni^da\\DuH kAma^mindra#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">5,32,12.</ls> {#indrA^somA pa\\kvamA\\mAsva\\ntarni gavA\\midda^DaTurva\\kzaRA^su#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV.\">6,72,4.</ls> {#prAyaRIyasya nizkAsaM nidaDyAt#}\n<ls>AIT. BR. 1,11.</ls>\n<ls>KĀTY. ŚR. 7,5,16.</ls> {#etadvE manuzyezu satyaM nihitaM yaccakzuH#}\n<ls>AIT. BR. 1,6.</ls> <ab>med.</ab>: {#sa Se^va\\DiM ni da^Di\\ze vi\\vasva^ti#}\n<ls>ṚV. 2,13,6.</ls>\n<ls>AV. 12,4,14.</ls> {#o\\da\\naM brA^hma\\Rezu^#}\n<ls n=\"AV.\">4,34,8.</ls> <ls n=\"AV.\">11,1,28.</ls> <ls n=\"AV. 11,1,\">33.</ls> <ls>ŚAT. BR. 2,2,1,14.</ls> <ls n=\"ŚAT. BR. 2,\">3,4,1.</ls> {#pra\\ti\\gfhyA\\ ni Da^tte#} {%хранить у себя%}\n<ls>ṚV. 1,125,1.</ls> {#sa\\nema\\ ni ca^ DImahi#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV. 1,\">17,6.</ls> — {#kvacinmuzitakaM niDAya#}\n<ls>DAŚAK.</ls> в <ls>BENF. Chr. 188,14.</ls> {#yaM tu paSyenniDiM rAjA purARaM nihitaM kzitO#}\n<ls>M. 8,38.</ls> {#(SamIm) tAmupAruhya nakulo DanUMzi nidaDe svayam#}\n<ls>MBH. 4,170.</ls> {#yajYapAtrARi ratnAnyABaraRAni ca . nyadaDuH pARqavA rAjannASrame vfzaparvaRaH ..#}\n<ls n=\"MBH.\">3,11549.</ls> <ls>R. 2,31,31.</ls> <ls n=\"R.\">5,32,31.</ls> {#Acazwa BavatIM devIM nihitAM rAvaRAlaye#}\n<ls n=\"R. 5,32,\">28.</ls> <ls n=\"R.\">4,63,17.</ls> <ls>KATHĀS. 10,109.</ls> {#(idaM DanuH) fcIke BArgave nyAsaM nyadaDAdvizRuH#}\n<ls>R. GORR. 1,77,24.</ls> {#Danam . haste hir