{"key1": "DA", "subcard": "_d_a~~h0_78_atisam", "iast": "atisamdhā", "h": "atisamdhā", "sense_tag": "1", "ru": "<div n=\"1\"> 1) {%вводить в заблуждение, обманывать кого-либо%}: {#kiM punarimAmatisaMDAya laByate#}\n<ls>ŚĀK. 69,23.</ls> {#tvayA candramasA ca viSvasanIyAByAmatisaMDIyate kAmijanasArTaH#}\n<ls n=\"ŚĀK.\">32.</ls> <ls n=\"ŚĀK.\">5.</ls> An beiden Stellen hat die <ab>v. l.</ab> {#aBisaM˚#} .", "de": "<div n=\"1\"> 1) {%Jmd anführen, betrügen%}: {#kiM punarimAmatisaMDAya laByate#}\n<ls>ŚĀK. 69,23.</ls> {#tvayA candramasA ca viSvasanIyAByAmatisaMDIyate kAmijanasArTaH#}\n<ls n=\"ŚĀK.\">32.</ls> <ls n=\"ŚĀK.\">5.</ls> An beiden Stellen hat die <ab>v. l.</ab> {#aBisaM˚#} .", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "", "differentia": "Значение обмана, мошенничества по отношению к лицу.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "DA", "safe_root": "_d_a", "rootmap_sha256": "29ac182af41e4be8254a0a137fc08a355153b793cba4e1fdd80ef35b423f90fd", "input_raw_sha256": "a86d60448077987e038c1192e6567913352271dfc35268c8fc89c9bb285870d4", "input_portrait_sha256": "8f0efd57d574d8c1f261a2d5a2dea06158717684c4d7776b170f7c524f070548", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:31:06Z", "wf_file": "wf_output_da_b.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}, "dcs_freq": {"band": 0, "count": 0, "hapax": false, "attested": false, "core80": false, "matched": "none", "matched_key": ""}, "en": "<div n=\"p\">— {#atisam#}\n<div n=\"1\"> 1) to lead someone on, deceive, cheat: {#kiM punarimAmatisaMDAya laByate#}\n<ls>ŚĀK. 69,23.</ls> {#tvayA candramasA ca viSvasanIyAByAmatisaMDIyate kAmijanasArTaH#}\n<ls n=\"ŚĀK.\">32.</ls> <ls n=\"ŚĀK.\">5.</ls> In both passages the <ab>v. l.</ab> {#aBisaM˚#}."}
{"key1": "DA", "subcard": "_d_a~~h0_78_atisam", "iast": "atisamdhā", "h": "atisamdhā", "sense_tag": "2", "ru": "<div n=\"1\">— 2) {%умалять предмет, давать ему не полную значимость%} so <ab>v. a.</ab> {%не давать ему выступить в его истинном значении, наносить ущерб%}: {#mUladvAraM nAnyErdvArEratisaMdaDIta rUpardDyAm . GawaPalapattrapramaTAdiBiSca tanmaNgalEScinuyAt ..#}\n<ls>VARĀH. BṚH. S. 52,82.</ls>", "de": "<div n=\"1\">— 2) {%einen Gegenstand anführen. zu kurz kommen lassen%} so <ab>v. a.</ab> {%ihn nicht in seiner wahren Bedeutung hervortreten lassen, beeinträchtigen%}: {#mUladvAraM nAnyErdvArEratisaMdaDIta rUpardDyAm . GawaPalapattrapramaTAdiBiSca tanmaNgalEScinuyAt ..#}\n<ls>VARĀH. BṚH. S. 52,82.</ls>", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "", "differentia": "Значение ущерба, умаления применительно к предмету, а не к лицу; в отличие от знач. 1.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "DA", "safe_root": "_d_a", "rootmap_sha256": "29ac182af41e4be8254a0a137fc08a355153b793cba4e1fdd80ef35b423f90fd", "input_raw_sha256": "a86d60448077987e038c1192e6567913352271dfc35268c8fc89c9bb285870d4", "input_portrait_sha256": "8f0efd57d574d8c1f261a2d5a2dea06158717684c4d7776b170f7c524f070548", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:31:06Z", "wf_file": "wf_output_da_b.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}, "dcs_freq": {"band": 0, "count": 0, "hapax": false, "attested": false, "core80": false, "matched": "none", "matched_key": ""}, "en": "<div n=\"1\">— 2) to misrepresent an object, to cause it to fall short, thus <ab>v. a.</ab> not to let it emerge in its true significance, to detract from it: {#mUladvAraM nAnyErdvArEratisaMdaDIta rUpardDyAm . GawaPalapattrapramaTAdiBiSca tanmaNgalEScinuyAt ..#}\n<ls>VARĀH. BṚH. S. 52,82.</ls>"}
