{"key1": "DA", "subcard": "_d_a~~h0_81_a_bisam", "iast": "abhisamdhā", "h": "abhisamdhā", "sense_tag": "8", "ru": "<div n=\"1\">— 8) {%стремиться привлечь к себе —, склонить кого-либо%}: {#aBisaMDAtumAreBe hanUmAnaNgadaM tataH#}\n(<ab>Schol.</ab> = {#saMDAtum#} {%примирить%} mit Ergänzung von {#saha grIveRa#})\n<ls>R. 4,54,5.</ls> {%примкнуть к, вступить в союз с%}: {#balIyasABisaMDAya#}\n<ls>KĀM. NĪTIS. 9,64.</ls>", "de": "<div n=\"1\">— 8) {%Jmd an sich zu ziehen —, zu gewinnen suchen%}: {#aBisaMDAtumAreBe hanUmAnaNgadaM tataH#}\n(<ab>Schol.</ab> = {#saMDAtum#} {%versöhnen%} mit Ergänzung von {#saha grIveRa#})\n<ls>R. 4,54,5.</ls> {%sich anschliessen an, sich verbünden mit%}: {#balIyasABisaMDAya#}\n<ls>KĀM. NĪTIS. 9,64.</ls>", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "", "differentia": "", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "DA", "safe_root": "_d_a", "rootmap_sha256": "29ac182af41e4be8254a0a137fc08a355153b793cba4e1fdd80ef35b423f90fd", "input_raw_sha256": "a98f6d1b024227f7d639ac00724f30055f5efdcd6c4b84af4654d87620c8f168", "input_portrait_sha256": "9d66a6394359a338593a291de43803973eaec9acd8e4424ae3e2bedb8437e4e1", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:31:06Z", "wf_file": "wf_output_da_b.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}, "dcs_freq": {"band": 0, "count": 0, "hapax": false, "attested": false, "core80": false, "matched": "none", "matched_key": ""}, "en": "<div n=\"1\">— 8) to seek to draw someone to oneself, to seek to win over: {#aBisaMDAtumAreBe hanUmAnaNgadaM tataH#}\n(<ab>Schol.</ab> = {#saMDAtum#} to reconcile with the addition of {#saha grIveRa#})\n<ls>R. 4,54,5.</ls> to attach oneself to, to ally oneself with: {#balIyasABisaMDAya#}\n<ls>KĀM. NĪTIS. 9,64.</ls>"}
