{"key1": "DA", "subcard": "_d_a~~h0_zz_pw01", "iast": "dhā", "h": "dhā", "sense_tag": "Mit {T273} 3", "ru": "3〉 {%Ставить —, класть —, втыкать на, к или в%} (<ab>Loc.</ab>). {#astram#} {%накладывать на стрелу%}. {#garBam#} {%помещать зародыш внутрь%}, так <ab>v. a.</ab> {%оплодотворять%}. {#savitus#} {%класть на солнце%}. {#dfzwim, cittam, cetas, matim, manas#} {%направлять взор, ум, мысли на%} (<ab>Loc.</ab>). {#matim#} и {#manas#} {%составлять замысел%} (дополнение в прямой речи с {#iti#}). {#AtmAnam, manas#} без дополнения {%сосредоточивать ум на одной точке, собираться с духом, брать себя в руки%}. Без <ab>Acc.</ab> {%погружаться в молитву, молиться%} <ls>BĀLAR. 110,10</ls>.", "de": "<div n=\"1\">— 3〉 {%setzen —, legen —, stecken auf, an oder in%} (<ab>Loc.</ab>). {#astram#} {%dem Pfeil auflegen%}. {#garBam#} {%eine Leibesfrucht hineinlegen,%} so <ab>v. a.</ab> {%befruchten%}. {#savitus#} {%in die Sonne legen%}. {#dfzwim, cittam, cetas, matim, manas#} {%den Blick, den Geist, die Gedanken richten auf%} (<ab>Loc.</ab>). {#matim#} und {#manas#} {%den Gedanken fassen%} (die Ergänzung in directer Rede mit {#iti#}). {#AtmAnam, manas#} ohne Ergänzung {%seinen Geist auf einen Punkt richten, sich sammeln, sich fassen%}. Ohne <ab>Acc.</ab> {%sich in ein Gebet verliefen, beten%} <ls>BĀLAR. 110,10</ls>.", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "", "differentia": "", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "DA", "safe_root": "_d_a", "rootmap_sha256": "29ac182af41e4be8254a0a137fc08a355153b793cba4e1fdd80ef35b423f90fd", "input_raw_sha256": "714ab934b2d7a2eeab7fc9798e06b30b29edecfa135d81f4189ce6d1222ee7a7", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:31:06Z", "wf_file": "wf_output_da_b.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}, "dcs_freq": {"band": 5, "count": 4861, "hapax": false, "attested": true, "core80": true, "matched": "compound", "matched_key": "dhā", "pos": {"counts": {"VERB": 4694, "NOUN": 8, "ADJ": 159}, "shares": {"VERB": 0.9656, "NOUN": 0.0016, "ADJ": 0.0327}, "band": {"VERB": 5, "NOUN": 4, "ADJ": 5}, "dominant": "VERB", "dominant_share": 0.9656, "total": 4861}, "genre": {"counts": {"sastra": 86, "kosa": 31, "bhasya": 33, "karika": 1, "sutra": 636, "smrti": 32, "purana": 138, "kavya": 14, "epic": 141, "vyakarana": 10, "tantra": 15, "katha": 28, "natya": 6, "upanisad": 50, "bauddha": 14, "brahmana": 1178, "rgveda": 1004, "atharva": 492, "yajus": 858}, "band": {"sastra": 5, "kosa": 5, "bhasya": 5, "karika": 3, "sutra": 5, "smrti": 5, "purana": 5, "kavya": 5, "epic": 5, "vyakarana": 5, "tantra": 5, "katha": 5, "natya": 5, "upanisad": 5, "bauddha": 5, "brahmana": 5, "rgveda": 5, "atharva": 5, "yajus": 5}}, "era": {"counts": {"Classical": 194, "Sutra-Sastra": 680, "Epic-Purana": 311, "Brahmana-Upanisad": 1228, "Vedic": 2354}, "band": {"Classical": 5, "Sutra-Sastra": 5, "Epic-Purana": 5, "Brahmana-Upanisad": 5, "Vedic": 5}}}, "en": "<div n=\"1\">— 3〉 to set, lay, or insert upon, at, or in (<ab>Loc.</ab>). {#astram#} to lay upon the arrow. {#garBam#} to insert an embryo, hence <ab>v. a.</ab> to fertilise. {#savitus#} to place in the sun. {#dfzwim, cittam, cetas, matim, manas#} to direct the gaze, mind, and thoughts upon (<ab>Loc.</ab>). {#matim#} and {#manas#} to form the thought (the complement in direct speech with {#iti#}). {#AtmAnam, manas#} without complement: to fix one's mind on a single point, to collect oneself, to compose oneself. Without <ab>Acc.</ab>: to lose oneself in prayer, to pray <ls>BĀLAR. 110,10</ls>."}
