{"key1": "DA", "subcard": "_d_a~~h0_zz_pw01", "iast": "dhā", "h": "dhā", "sense_tag": "Mit {T273} 10e", "ru": "e〉 {%направлять всё своё внимание на что-либо, всецело отдаваться чему-либо%} (с <ab>Acc.</ab>); <ab>Act.</ab> <ls>BHAṬṬ.</ls> {#samAhita#} {%всецело поглощённый чем-либо, способный всецело отдаваться чему-либо, целиком погружённый во что-либо%} (о людях и об уме), {%направляющий всё внимание на одну точку%}. Дополнение в <ab>Loc.</ab> или в <ab>Comp.</ab> предшествующем; часто без дополнения (<ls>ĀPAST. 1,1,11. 5,7. 13,18</ls>).", "de": "<div n=\"2\">— e〉 {%seine ganze Aufmerksamkeit auf Etwas richten, sich ganz einer Sache hingeben%} (mit <ab>Acc.</ab>); <ab>Act.</ab> <ls>BHAṬṬ.</ls> {#samAhita#} {%ganz bei einer Sache seiend, sich einer Sache ganz hinzugeben vermögend, in Etwas ganz aufgehend%} (von Personen und vom Geiste), {%seine ganze Aufmerksamkeit auf einen Punkt richtend%}. Die Ergänzung im <ab>Loc.</ab> oder im <ab>Comp.</ab> vorangehend; häufig ohne Ergänzung (<ls>ĀPAST. 1,1,11. 5,7. 13,18</ls>).", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "", "differentia": "", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "DA", "safe_root": "_d_a", "rootmap_sha256": "29ac182af41e4be8254a0a137fc08a355153b793cba4e1fdd80ef35b423f90fd", "input_raw_sha256": "714ab934b2d7a2eeab7fc9798e06b30b29edecfa135d81f4189ce6d1222ee7a7", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:31:06Z", "wf_file": "wf_output_da_b.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}, "dcs_freq": {"band": 5, "count": 4861, "hapax": false, "attested": true, "core80": true, "matched": "compound", "matched_key": "dhā", "pos": {"counts": {"VERB": 4694, "NOUN": 8, "ADJ": 159}, "shares": {"VERB": 0.9656, "NOUN": 0.0016, "ADJ": 0.0327}, "band": {"VERB": 5, "NOUN": 4, "ADJ": 5}, "dominant": "VERB", "dominant_share": 0.9656, "total": 4861}, "genre": {"counts": {"sastra": 86, "kosa": 31, "bhasya": 33, "karika": 1, "sutra": 636, "smrti": 32, "purana": 138, "kavya": 14, "epic": 141, "vyakarana": 10, "tantra": 15, "katha": 28, "natya": 6, "upanisad": 50, "bauddha": 14, "brahmana": 1178, "rgveda": 1004, "atharva": 492, "yajus": 858}, "band": {"sastra": 5, "kosa": 5, "bhasya": 5, "karika": 3, "sutra": 5, "smrti": 5, "purana": 5, "kavya": 5, "epic": 5, "vyakarana": 5, "tantra": 5, "katha": 5, "natya": 5, "upanisad": 5, "bauddha": 5, "brahmana": 5, "rgveda": 5, "atharva": 5, "yajus": 5}}, "era": {"counts": {"Classical": 194, "Sutra-Sastra": 680, "Epic-Purana": 311, "Brahmana-Upanisad": 1228, "Vedic": 2354}, "band": {"Classical": 5, "Sutra-Sastra": 5, "Epic-Purana": 5, "Brahmana-Upanisad": 5, "Vedic": 5}}}, "en": "<div n=\"2\">— e〉 to direct one's full attention to something, to devote oneself entirely to a matter (with <ab>Acc.</ab>); <ab>Act.</ab> <ls>BHAṬṬ.</ls> {#samAhita#} wholly absorbed in a matter, capable of devoting oneself entirely to something, wholly engrossed in something (of persons and of the mind), directing one's full attention to a single point. The complement in the <ab>Loc.</ab> or preceding in the <ab>Comp.</ab>; frequently without complement (<ls>ĀPAST. 1,1,11. 5,7. 13,18</ls>)."}
