{"key1": "Sru", "subcard": "_sru~~h0_07__a", "iast": "āśru", "h": "āśru", "sense_tag": "3)", "ru": "<div n=\"1\">— 3) обещать, давать слово; с <ab>acc.</ab> вещи и <ab>dat.</ab> лица\n<ls>P. 1,4,40.</ls>\n<ls>VOP. 5,15.</ls>\n<ls>R. ed. Bomb. 2,58,27.</ls> {#ASruta#} обещанный, данный в обещание\n<ls>AK. 3,2,58.</ls>\n<ls>H. 1489.</ls> {#kuryAdyaTASrutam#}\n<ls>YĀJÑ. 2,196.</ls>", "de": "<div n=\"1\">— 3) {%zusagen, versprechen%}; mit <ab>acc.</ab> der Sache und <ab>dat.</ab> der Person\n<ls>P. 1,4,40.</ls>\n<ls>VOP. 5,15.</ls>\n<ls>R. ed. Bomb. 2,58,27.</ls> {#ASruta#} {%zugesagt, versprochen%}\n<ls>AK. 3,2,58.</ls>\n<ls>H. 1489.</ls> {#kuryAdyaTASrutam#}\n<ls>YĀJÑ. 2,196.</ls>", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "", "differentia": "Семантический сдвиг «слышать» → «отвечать» → «обещать»; специфическое употребление в ритуальных и юридических контекстах", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "Sru", "safe_root": "_sru", "rootmap_sha256": "c315c9819dd7aaa229fcc7dfe85fda5e4b67e256745aa3962036c9d31b3461c6", "input_raw_sha256": "88dfcb45f43bfd49ef92698315048c8ddc65c08ae069b442ef00a52c342146c5", "input_portrait_sha256": "9a354fc8d3555dbbee6f9afba342854d7aa42370ba72a4773ffcaebb34605ab4", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T14:09:52Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sd.Sru.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}, "dcs_freq": {"band": 3, "count": 15, "hapax": false, "attested": true, "core80": false, "matched": "compound", "matched_key": "āśru", "pos": {"counts": {"VERB": 15}, "shares": {"VERB": 1.0}, "band": {"VERB": 4}, "dominant": "VERB", "dominant_share": 1.0, "total": 15}, "genre": {"counts": {"purana": 3, "katha": 1, "rgveda": 3, "atharva": 2, "sutra": 5, "upanisad": 1, "brahmana": 1}, "band": {"purana": 3, "katha": 2, "rgveda": 4, "atharva": 3, "sutra": 4, "upanisad": 2, "brahmana": 2}}, "era"