{"key1": "jYA", "subcard": "j_y_a~~h0_00_pwg00", "iast": "jñā", "h": "jñā", "sense_tag": "sense-1-subframe-familiar", "ru": "<ls>MBH. 3,2154.</ls> быть знакомым, близким: {#U\\rDvA te\\ anu^ sU\\nftA\\ mana^stizWatu jAna\\tI#}\n<ls>ṚV. 1,134,1.</ls> {#jA\\nanne\\va #}\n{# jA^na\\tIrnitya\\ A Sa^ye#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV. 1,\">140,7.</ls> <ls n=\"ṚV.\">9,96,7.</ls> доверительно навещать кого-либо: {#jA\\nIhi kf^tye ka\\rtAra^M duhi\\teva^ pi\\tara\\M svam#}", "de": "<ls>MBH. 3,2154.</ls> {%bekannt, vertraut sein%}: {#U\\rDvA te\\ anu^ sU\\nftA\\ mana^stizWatu jAna\\tI#}\n<ls>ṚV. 1,134,1.</ls> {#jA\\nanne\\va #}\n{# jA^na\\tIrnitya\\ A Sa^ye#}\n<ls n=\"ṚV. 1,\">140,7.</ls> <ls n=\"ṚV.\">9,96,7.</ls> {%Jmd vertraulich aufsuchen%}: {#jA\\nIhi kf^tye ka\\rtAra^M duhi\\teva^ pi\\tara\\M svam#}", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Classical", "differentia": "Стативный оттенок «быть в близких отношениях»; частный случай — доверительный визит.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "jYA", "safe_root": "j_y_a", "rootmap_sha256": "bf6e4b93b46d64f5afc647833dbc171c7d865578b67eaecbf22a1e04aabb1f2b", "input_raw_sha256": "cee4d839467e40c454b6b3ca211a1be3de5a07d01c88c43cb1cd6122d3676e3e", "input_portrait_sha256": "ca9991cfc0e0c951f44f0879d7f0d0b44f5fd1bc0963fd1b6c3bd5e6dd636eeb", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T14:09:41Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sd.jYA.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}, "dcs_freq": {"band": 5, "count": 5059, "hapax": false, "attested": true, "core80": true, "matched": "compound", "matched_key": "jñā", "pos": {"counts": {"NOUN": 14, "VERB": 5041, "ADJ": 4}, "shares": {"NOUN": 0.0028, "VERB": 0.9964, "ADJ": 0.0008}, "band": {"NOUN": 5, "VERB": 5, "ADJ": 4}, "dominant": "VERB", "dominant_share": 0.9964, "total": 5059}, "genre": {"counts": {"vyakarana": 87, "sastra": 997, "kosa": 239,