{"key1": "jYA", "subcard": "j_y_a~~h0_00_pwg01", "iast": "jñā", "h": "jñā", "sense_tag": "sense-2", "ru": "<div n=\"1\">— 2) признавать; одобрять, считать правильным: {#taM sma^ jAnIta para\\me vyo^man#}\n<ls>VS. 18,59.</ls> <ls n=\"VS. 18,\">60.</ls> {#sarva\\M tada^gne sukf\\tasya^ lo\\ke jAnI\\tAnna^H sa\\Mgama^ne paTI\\nAm#}\n<ls>AV. 9,5,19.</ls> {#tadvE devA na jajYuH#}\n<ls>ŚAT. BR. 1,6,1,2.</ls> <ls n=\"ŚAT. BR. 1,\">8,1,8.</ls> {#tadDAsya jajYuH#}\n<ls n=\"ŚAT. BR.\">11,6,2,5.</ls> {#taTA nastvaM tAta jAnITA yaTA tattuByamavocam#} ты можешь мне признать, что\n<ls n=\"ŚAT. BR.\">14,9,1,6.</ls> {#tAni jYAtuM daDrire#}\n<ls n=\"ŚAT. BR. 14,\">4,3,32.</ls>", "de": "<div n=\"1\">— 2) {%anerkennen; gutheissen, billigen%}: {#taM sma^ jAnIta para\\me vyo^man#}\n<ls>VS. 18,59.</ls> <ls n=\"VS. 18,\">60.</ls> {#sarva\\M tada^gne sukf\\tasya^ lo\\ke jAnI\\tAnna^H sa\\Mgama^ne paTI\\nAm#}\n<ls>AV. 9,5,19.</ls> {#tadvE devA na jajYuH#}\n<ls>ŚAT. BR. 1,6,1,2.</ls> <ls n=\"ŚAT. BR. 1,\">8,1,8.</ls> {#tadDAsya jajYuH#}\n<ls n=\"ŚAT. BR.\">11,6,2,5.</ls> {#taTA nastvaM tAta jAnITA yaTA tattuByamavocam#} {%du mögest mir zugeben, dass%}\n<ls n=\"ŚAT. BR.\">14,9,1,6.</ls> {#tAni jYAtuM daDrire#}\n<ls n=\"ŚAT. BR. 14,\">4,3,32.</ls>", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Epic / early-Classical", "differentia": "Социально-оценочный сдвиг от «знать» к «признавать / одобрять»; corpus: одобрить (Vedic). Differentia от sense-1: здесь не когнитивный акт, а волевое признание чужой правоты.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "jYA", "safe_root": "j_y_a", "rootmap_sha256": "bf6e4b93b46d64f5afc647833dbc171c7d865578b67eaecbf22a1e04aabb1f2b", "input_raw_sha256": "d890707ee9529dc0d3f53b1b9bc2d0a255e983f396bea78de662f0de467505a1", "input_portrait_sha256": "ca9991cfc0e0c951f44f0879d7f0d0b44f5fd1bc0963fd1b6c3