{"key1": "jYA", "subcard": "j_y_a~~h0_00_pwg01", "iast": "jñā", "h": "jñā", "sense_tag": "sense-3", "ru": "<div n=\"1\">— 3) признавать своим, брать во владение (<ab>vgl.</ab> <ab>u.</ab> {#sam): yacca me kiMcidasti pratyAtmakaM DanaM taM#} (sic) {#sarvameza eva jAnAti#}\n<ls>SADDH. P. 4,25,b.</ls>", "de": "<div n=\"1\">— 3) {%als das seinige anerkennen, in Besitz nehmen%} (<ab>vgl.</ab> <ab>u.</ab> {#sam): yacca me kiMcidasti pratyAtmakaM DanaM taM#} (sic) {#sarvameza eva jAnAti#}\n<ls>SADDH. P. 4,25,b.</ls>", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Classical", "differentia": "Юридически-посессивный оттенок: «признать своим» → «присвоить, завладеть». Differentia от sense-2: не просто одобрение, а присвоение.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "jYA", "safe_root": "j_y_a", "rootmap_sha256": "bf6e4b93b46d64f5afc647833dbc171c7d865578b67eaecbf22a1e04aabb1f2b", "input_raw_sha256": "d890707ee9529dc0d3f53b1b9bc2d0a255e983f396bea78de662f0de467505a1", "input_portrait_sha256": "ca9991cfc0e0c951f44f0879d7f0d0b44f5fd1bc0963fd1b6c3bd5e6dd636eeb", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T14:09:41Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sd.jYA.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}, "dcs_freq": {"band": 5, "count": 5059, "hapax": false, "attested": true, "core80": true, "matched": "compound", "matched_key": "jñā", "pos": {"counts": {"NOUN": 14, "VERB": 5041, "ADJ": 4}, "shares": {"NOUN": 0.0028, "VERB": 0.9964, "ADJ": 0.0008}, "band": {"NOUN": 5, "VERB": 5, "ADJ": 4}, "dominant": "VERB", "dominant_share": 0.9964, "total": 5059}, "genre": {"counts": {"vyakarana": 87, "sastra": 997, "kosa": 239, "tantra": 177, "sutra": 65, "bhasya": 349, "karika": 26, "smrti": 175, "upanisad": 40, "purana": 771, "bauddha": 329, "kavya": 47, "epic": 1518, "katha": 322, "natya": 20, "brahmana": 69, "rgveda": 56, "atharva": 47, "yajus":