{"key1": "jYA", "subcard": "j_y_a~~h0_01_sec_1", "iast": "jñā", "h": "jñā (caus.)", "sense_tag": "caus-sense-inform", "ru": "<ls>ĀŚV. GṚHY. 4,7.</ls> давать знать о чём-либо (<ab>acc.</ab>), сообщать, возвещать: {#(tam) samAgamyAjYApayatsvaM prayojanam#}\n<ls>MBH. 2,558.</ls> {#parIkzya jYApayannarTAnna paScAtparitapyate#}\n<ls n=\"MBH.\">12,4149.</ls> {#utpAtena jYApyamAne#}\n<is>Vārtt</is>. 3 zu <ls>P. 2,3,13.</ls> учить чему-либо (<ab>acc.</ab>): {#etajjYApayatyAcAryaH, kiM jYApyate#}\n<ls>PAT.</ls> zu <ls>P. 2,4,66.</ls> <ls n=\"P.\">4,1,133.</ls>\n<is>Vārtt</is>. 1 zu <ls>P. 4,1,4.</ls> {#jYApita#}\n<ab>Sch.</ab> zu <ls>JAIM. 1,1,2.</ls> знакомить кого-либо (<ab>acc.</ab>) с чем-либо (<ab>acc.</ab>): {#SrAvitastvaM mayA guhyaM jYApitaSca sanAtanam . Darmam#}\n<ls>MBH. 14,415.</ls> {#kaTaM hi puRqrIkAkzo jYApitastadidaM Bavet#}\n<ls>HARIV. 10038.</ls> сообщать кому-либо (<ab>gen.</ab>) о ком-либо (<ab>acc.</ab>): {#tataste jYApayAmAsurDftarAzwrasya nAgarAH . pARqavAnagninA dagDAn#} они сообщили <is>Dhṛt</is>., что P. сгорели\n<ls>MBH. 1,5864.</ls> <ab>med.</ab> обращаться к кому-либо (<ab>acc.</ab>), просить, увещевать: {#tasmAttvAM devadeveSa lokArTaM jYApayAmaho . rakza lokAMSca devAMSca#}\n<ls n=\"MBH.\">3,8762.</ls> {#upamantrayate sa hiMkAro jYapayate sa prastAvaH striyA saha Sete sa udgITaH#}", "de": "<ls>ĀŚV. GṚHY. 4,7.</ls> {%Etwas%} (<ab>acc.</ab>) {%zu wissen thun, mittheilen, verkünden%}: {#(tam) samAgamyAjYApayatsvaM prayojanam#}\n<ls>MBH. 2,558.</ls> {#parIkzya jYApayannarTAnna paScAtparitapyate#}\n<ls n=\"MBH.\">12,4149.</ls> {#utpAtena jYApyamAne#}\n<is>Vārtt</is>. 3 zu <ls>P. 2,3,13.</ls> {%Etwas%} (<ab>acc.</ab>) {%lehren%}: {#etajjYApayatyAcAryaH, kiM jYApyate#}\n<ls>PAT.</ls> zu <ls>P. 2,4,66.</ls> <ls n=\"P.\">4,1,133.</ls>\n<is>Vārtt</is>. 1 zu <ls>P. 4,1,4.</ls> {#jYApita#}\n<ab>Sch.</ab> zu <ls>JAIM. 1,1,2.</ls> {%Jmd%} (<ab>acc.</ab>) {%mit Etwas%} (<ab>acc.</ab>) {%bekanntmachen%}: {#SrAvitastvaM mayA guhyaM jYApitaSca sanAtanam . Darmam#}\n<ls>MBH. 14,415.</ls> {#kaTaM hi puRqrIkAkzo jYApitastadidaM Bavet#}\n<ls>HARIV. 10038.</ls> {%Jmd%} (<ab>gen.</ab>) {%von Jmd%} (<ab>acc.</ab>) {%berichten%}: {#tataste jYApayAmAsurDftarAzwrasya nAgarAH . pARqavAnagninA dagDAn#} {%sie theilten dem%} <is>Dhṛt</is>. {%mit, dass die%}\nP. {%verbrannt wären%}\n<ls>MBH. 1,5864.</ls> <ab>med.</ab> {%Jmd%} (<ab>acc.</ab>) {%angehen, bitten, zusprechen%}: {#tasmAttvAM devadeveSa lokArTaM jYApayAmaho . rakza lokAMSca devAMSca#}\n<ls n=\"MBH.\">3,8762.</ls> {#upamantrayate sa hiMkAro jYapayate sa prastAvaH striyA saha Sete sa udgITaH#}", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Epic / early-Classical", "differentia": "Информативное значение каузатива: доводить до сведения, сообщать, возвещать; также просить / обращаться.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "jYA", "safe_root": "j_y_a", "rootmap_sha256": "bf6e4b93b46d64f5afc647833dbc171c7d865578b67eaecbf22a1e04aabb1f2b", "input_raw_sha256": "0a75ff264c2fb7ff22450587ac4fc265ea048443aedf177f079fc2a90a5caaa2", "input_portrait_sha256": "ca9991cfc0e0c951f44f0879d7f0d0b44f5fd1bc0963fd1b6c3bd5e6dd636eeb", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T14:09:41Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sd.jYA.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}, "dcs_freq": {"band": 5, "count": 5059, "hapax": false, "attested": true, "core80": true, "matched": "compound", "matched_key": "jñā", "pos": {"counts": {"NOUN": 14, "VERB": 5041, "ADJ": 4}, "shares": {"NOUN": 0.0028, "VERB": 0.9964, "ADJ": 0.0008}, "band": {"NOUN": 5, "VERB": 5, "ADJ": 4}, "dominant": "VERB", "dominant_share": 0.9964, "total": 5059}, "genre": {"counts": {"vyakarana": 87, "sastra": 997, "kosa": 239, "tantra": 177, "sutra": 65, "bhasya": 349, "karika": 26, "smrti": 175, "upanisad": 40, "purana": 771, "bauddha": 329, "kavya": 47, "epic": 1518, "katha": 322, "natya": 