{"key1": "muc", "subcard": "muc~~h0_26_prati", "iast": "pratimuc", "h": "pratimuc", "sense_tag": "2", "ru": "<div n=\"1\">— 2) отпускать кого-л. на свободу, освобождать: {#mahAkratoramuM turaMgaM pratimoktumarhasi#}\n<ls>RAGH. 3,46.</ls> {#gfhItapratimukta#}\n<ls n=\"RAGH.\">4,43.</ls> {#aDvaSrAnta iti kzipraM pratimuktaH kzamABujA#}\n<ls>RĀJA-TAR. 4,556.</ls>\n<ls>KATHĀS. 44,60.</ls> <ls n=\"KATHĀS.\">54,63.</ls> отпускать что-л., отказываться от: {#CAyAsu pratimuktaSazpakavalaM nidrAyate gokulam#}\n<ls>MṚCCH. 116,10.</ls> {#prAptamarTaM tu yo mAhocCAntvanEH pratimuYcati#}\n<ls>Spr. 1898.</ls> погашать (долг)\n<ls>MBH. 6,5083.</ls> <ab>med.</ab> освобождаться от: {#kilvizAtpratimucyate#}\n<ls>M. 10,118.</ls> {#BayAt#}\n<ls n=\"MBH.\">13,1659.</ls> {#narakAtpratimuktaH#}\n<ls>MĀRK. P. 15,1.</ls> освобождать(!): {#tiryagyonO gatAMScEva#} (так новейшая <ab>Ausg.</ab>) {#karmaBirnirayopamEH . tAnapi pratimucyeta brahmayuktena cetasA ..#}\n<ls>HARIV. 11619.</ls>", "de": "<div n=\"1\">— 2) {%Jmd freilassen, entlassen%}: {#mahAkratoramuM turaMgaM pratimoktumarhasi#}\n<ls>RAGH. 3,46.</ls> {#gfhItapratimukta#}\n<ls n=\"RAGH.\">4,43.</ls> {#aDvaSrAnta iti kzipraM pratimuktaH kzamABujA#}\n<ls>RĀJA-TAR. 4,556.</ls>\n<ls>KATHĀS. 44,60.</ls> <ls n=\"KATHĀS.\">54,63.</ls> {%Etwas fahren lassen, aufgeben%}: {#CAyAsu pratimuktaSazpakavalaM nidrAyate gokulam#}\n<ls>MṚCCH. 116,10.</ls> {#prAptamarTaM tu yo mAhocCAntvanEH pratimuYcati#}\n<ls>Spr. 1898.</ls> {%abtragen%} (eine Schuld)\n<ls>MBH. 6,5083.</ls> <ab>med.</ab> {%sich befreien von%}: {#kilvizAtpratimucyate#}\n<ls>M. 10,118.</ls> {#BayAt#}\n<ls n=\"MBH.\">13,1659.</ls> {#narakAtpratimuktaH#}\n<ls>MĀRK. P. 15,1.</ls> {%befreien(!)%}: {#tiryagyonO gatAMScEva#} (so die neuere <ab>Ausg.</ab>) {#karmaBirnirayopamEH . tAnapi pratimucyeta brahmayuktena cetasA ..#}\n<ls>HARIV. 11619.</ls>", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "", "differentia": "freilassen, entlassen — отпускать на свободу, освобожд