{"key1": "siD", "subcard": "si_d~~h0_16_pra", "iast": "pra+sidh", "h": "1", "sense_tag": "1", "ru": "<div n=\"p\">— {#pra#} погонять вперёд, двигать вперёд: {#tAByAM yuktvA prAseDatsa udajayat#}\n<ls>PAÑCAV. BR. 14,3,13.</ls> {#gAvO^ yu\\ktO mo zu pra se^DI\\rmuhu\\rinma^manDi#} не езди вперёд, не продолжай движения\n<ls>ṚV. 10,27,20.</ls> <ab>med.</ab>: {#DanuzkeRAnizuRA vrAtyAH praseDamAnA yanti#}\n<ls>LĀṬY. 8,6,8.</ls>", "de": "<div n=\"p\">— {#pra#} {%vorwärts treiben%}: {#tAByAM yuktvA prAseDatsa udajayat#}\n<ls>PAÑCAV. BR. 14,3,13.</ls> {#gAvO^ yu\\ktO mo zu pra se^DI\\rmuhu\\rinma^manDi#} {%fahre nicht zu%}\n<ls>ṚV. 10,27,20.</ls> <ab>med.</ab>: {#DanuzkeRAnizuRA vrAtyAH praseDamAnA yanti#}\n<ls>LĀṬY. 8,6,8.</ls>", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Epic / early-Classical", "differentia": "vorwärts treiben = понуждать к движению вперёд (каузатив); fahre nicht zu = запретительное употребление", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "siD", "safe_root": "si_d", "rootmap_sha256": "eaab3fff0eaafb34b52fe1f13c37961b60626d4e04f03ff1daa625e5b3033570", "input_raw_sha256": "c64b6f8e5435fdbebe9b06020c75ff1aa3f93addb7e4340dd7193d63c6112a78", "input_portrait_sha256": "9f2cae07562b7ea82893c939384b201f9f7f778af0d58430e710efc8e77d9be7", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T14:09:59Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sd.siD.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}, "dcs_freq": {"band": 4, "count": 450, "hapax": false, "attested": true, "core80": true, "matched": "compound", "matched_key": "prasidh", "pos": {"counts": {"VERB": 450}, "shares": {"VERB": 1.0}, "band": {"VERB": 5}, "dominant": "VERB", "dominant_share": 1.0, "total": 450}, "genre": {"counts": {"brahmana": 1, "sastra": 223, "kosa": 8, "sutra": 53, "tantra": 8, "bhasya": 233, "karika": 7, "smrti": 20, "bauddha": 3, "epic": 10, "vyakarana": 10, "p