{"key1": "siD", "subcard": "si_d~~h0_zz_nws00", "iast": "sidh", "h": "sidh", "sense_tag": "NWS-19", "ru": "[Gen , unsp] [ siddha ] достигший своей цели, преуспевший. BhāgP. священный, святой, божественный, прославленный. W(MW). поражённый (как цель). Kathās. действительный (как правило грамматики). вытекающий из. W(MW). рассмотренный, решённый, завершённый (о судебном деле). W(MW). уплаченный, ликвидированный, урегулированный (о долге). W(MW). готовый к уплате (о деньгах). Hit. общеизвестный, пресловутый, знаменитый (= prasiddha). ĀśvŚS, R. MW : 1215 (s.v. siddha )", "de": "[Gen , unsp] [ siddha ] one who has attained his object, successful. BhāgP . sacred, holy, divine, illustrious. W(MW) . hit (as a mark). Kathās . valid (as a rule in grammar). resulting from. W(MW) . adjudicated, decided, terminated (as a lawsuit). W(MW) . paid, liquidated, settled (as a debt). W(MW) . ready for payment (as money). Hit . well-known, notorious, celebrated (= prasiddha ). ĀśvŚS , R . MW : 1215 (s.v. siddha )", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "mixed", "stratum": "", "differentia": "", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "siD", "safe_root": "si_d", "rootmap_sha256": "eaab3fff0eaafb34b52fe1f13c37961b60626d4e04f03ff1daa625e5b3033570", "input_raw_sha256": "7e9cb3dd7d96c2e73131cc71398e01ed5d42ae0c114bd1c1ef2be3c3143c7a54", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T14:09:59Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sd.siD.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}, "dcs_freq": {"band": 5, "count": 2028, "hapax": false, "attested": true, "core80": true, "matched": "compound", "matched_key": "sidh", "pos": {"counts": {"VERB": 2028}, "shares": {"VERB": 1.0}, "band": {"VERB": 5}, "dominant": "VERB", "dominant_share": 1.0, "total": 2028}, "genre": {"counts": {"s