{"key1": "siD", "subcard": "si_d~~h1_00_pwg01", "iast": "sidh", "h": "sidh", "sense_tag": "PPP 1m", "ru": "<div n=\"2\">— m) достигший своей цели\n<ls>BHĀG. P. 10,22,27.</ls> достигший высшей цели, ставший совершенным, — мастером в чём-л. (стоит в <ab>comp.</ab> на первом месте)\n<ls>VARĀH. BṚH. 21 (19),2.</ls> {#mantra˚#}\n<ls>MBH. 1,6310.</ls> {#karma˚#}\n<ls n=\"MBH. 1,\">6356.</ls> {#tapaH˚#}\n<ls n=\"MBH. 1,\">7668.</ls> <ls>R. 1,47,11.</ls> <ls>BHĀG. P. 7,3,17.</ls> {#anarTAya#} мастер в причинении вреда\n<ls>KATHĀS. 28,185.</ls>", "de": "<div n=\"2\">— m) {%der sein Ziel erreicht hat%}\n<ls>BHĀG. P. 10,22,27.</ls> {%der das höchste Ziel erreicht hat, zur Vollkommenheit gelangt —, Meister geworden in Etwas%} (geht im <ab>comp.</ab> voran)\n<ls>VARĀH. BṚH. 21 (19),2.</ls> {#mantra˚#}\n<ls>MBH. 1,6310.</ls> {#karma˚#}\n<ls n=\"MBH. 1,\">6356.</ls> {#tapaH˚#}\n<ls n=\"MBH. 1,\">7668.</ls> <ls>R. 1,47,11.</ls> <ls>BHĀG. P. 7,3,17.</ls> {#anarTAya#} {%Meister im Unheilstiften%}\n<ls>KATHĀS. 28,185.</ls>", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Epic / early-Classical", "differentia": "", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "siD", "safe_root": "si_d", "rootmap_sha256": "eaab3fff0eaafb34b52fe1f13c37961b60626d4e04f03ff1daa625e5b3033570", "input_raw_sha256": "8e9c0fafd2c886b5d1e746de4b76f67b0276dab4cf8bb8da155f3981f732bbac", "input_portrait_sha256": "37124175f7da5fd0cda28fae3e67e6aa3304e6cb49b0ef83152bbc04adf41b98", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T14:09:59Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sd.siD.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}, "dcs_freq": {"band": 5, "count": 2028, "hapax": false, "attested": true, "core80": true, "matched": "compound", "matched_key": "sidh", "pos": {"counts": {"VERB": 2028}, "shares": {"VERB": 1.0}, "band": {"VERB": 5}, "dominant": "VERB", "dominant_share": 1.0, "to