{"key1": "vas", "subcard": "vas~~h4_31_a_bisam", "iast": "aBisam+vas", "h": "aBisam+vas", "sense_tag": "1", "ru": "<div n=\"p\">— {#aBisam#} собираться вокруг, объединяться ради (чего-л.): {#a\\gniM gf\\hapa^tima\\Bi sa\\MvasA^nAH#}\n<ls>TBR. 3,7,4,4.</ls> {#sa kftti^kABira\\Bisa\\MvasA^naH#}\n<ls n=\"TBR. 3,\">1,1,1.</ls> <ls>LĀṬY. 2,9,1.</ls>", "de": "<div n=\"p\">— {#aBisam#} {%sich vereinigen um%}: {#a\\gniM gf\\hapa^tima\\Bi sa\\MvasA^nAH#}\n<ls>TBR. 3,7,4,4.</ls> {#sa kftti^kABira\\Bisa\\MvasA^naH#}\n<ls n=\"TBR. 3,\">1,1,1.</ls> <ls>LĀṬY. 2,9,1.</ls>", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Vedic", "differentia": "abhi+sam+vas: abhi- («к, навстречу») + sam- («вместе»): «сходиться к одному месту/цели»; семантически отличается от sam+vas тем, что акцент на направленном сближении, а не на совместном проживании.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "vas", "safe_root": "vas", "rootmap_sha256": "9b1f4aea16b894d73867844d18ee6d76f90b61201cf95df4af94d8db38c2a0d0", "input_raw_sha256": "6a71fe4674a43b6df58a17f7ed7e653aa471365958314e88fa90ebee9788140d", "input_portrait_sha256": "951986093bcd752c4993ed9eaed3215e03e3344ddaef3fe5f97d87ae1c743775", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T14:09:55Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sd.vas.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}, "dcs_freq": {"band": 5, "count": 2546, "hapax": false, "attested": true, "core80": true, "matched": "root_fallback", "matched_key": "vas", "pos": {"counts": {"VERB": 2538, "NOUN": 8}, "shares": {"VERB": 0.9969, "NOUN": 0.0031}, "band": {"VERB": 5, "NOUN": 4}, "dominant": "VERB", "dominant_share": 0.9969, "total": 2546}, "genre": {"counts": {"sastra": 75, "kosa": 5, "tantra": 23, "bhasya": 32, "sutra": 114, "smrti": 92, "purana": 525, "kavya": 36, "epic": 1077, "katha": 100, "bauddha": 28, "natya": 2, "karika": 1, "upanisad": 35, "br