,1.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 3,4,\">2.</ls> {#yaH saMsadi prakftiBirBavedyukta upAsitum . vanyErmfgErupAsInaH#} (mit <ab>pass.</ab> <ab>Bed.</ab>) {#so 'yamAste mamAgrajaH#}\n<ls n=\"R.\">2,100,29.</ls>\n[Page1-0733]\n{#rAkzasIBirupAsyantIM#} (<ab>pass.</ab>) {#samAsInAM SilAtale#}\n<ls>MBH. 3,16167.</ls> {#upAsito guruM BavAn, upAsito gururBavatA . upAsitaM BavatA#}\n<ls>P. 3,4,72</ls>, <ab>Sch.</ab>", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "mixed", "stratum": "", "differentia": "Root-fallback hint 'сидеть' from Vedic-stratum corpus candidates aligns with German 'sitzen'; rendered as 'сидеть рядом / садиться рядом', discriminated from plain 'сидеть' (sense 2) by the added positional nuance 'рядом' reflecting 'daneben'.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "As", "safe_root": "_as", "rootmap_sha256": "dd993995d36a397778241b21812e7a99d05eec1fb5ee650d8b80689cb766c3d4", "input_raw_sha256": "11e18e18ac578dbbfdf48927b7f3f07c8d14da0fddb5a3432be4762472dd5c47", "input_portrait_sha256": "e799a69d3fcba969a968caf5e8c3d571a1ecafabc609bcb6f5bd48ae62df4385", "generated_at": "2026-07-01T07:50:30Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.As.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
