{"key1": "Sam", "subcard": "_sam~~h0_zz_nws00", "iast": "śam", "h": "śam", "sense_tag": "NWS-11", "ru": "{#+ prati : (° śāmayati , also ° śam ° and erroneously ° śrām °, ° sam °) (1) stores away (property); (2) puts away (a monk’s bowl and robe, after his begging-round); (3) harbors (a person), entertains (privately). SaddhP 114.13 , Mvu i.56.2 , MSV ii.99.15 .#} [Buddh , unsp (s.v. pratiśāmayati )] – (° śāmaya -, ° śāme -): откладывать в сторону, убирать; приводить в порядок. AbhisDh § 8.5.9A2 . Buddh , unsp. [NWS: Karashima 2012 : 378 (s.v. prati - śāmaya -)]", "de": "{#+ prati : (° śāmayati , also ° śam ° and erroneously ° śrām °, ° sam °) (1) stores away (property); (2) puts away (a monk’s bowl and robe, after his begging-round); (3) harbors (a person), entertains (privately). SaddhP 114.13 , Mvu i.56.2 , MSV ii.99.15 .#} [Buddh , unsp (s.v. pratiśāmayati )] – (° śāmaya -, ° śāme -): weglegen, wegstellen; aufräumen. AbhisDh § 8.5.9A2 . Buddh , unsp", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Classical", "differentia": "", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "Sam", "safe_root": "_sam", "rootmap_sha256": "1256dd7e5e76146990481526283c4fd624a225293e6e4165d405b09eb0001aee", "input_raw_sha256": "e3c1f67716d3e21ebf892e05973026fe0838fbbe6cf0a0b0f06a4c5b73eb1a04", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-30T05:05:07Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.Sam.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
