{"key1": "banD", "subcard": "ban_d~~h0_16_pra", "iast": "pra+bandh", "h": "pra+bandh", "sense_tag": "Nachtrag-3a (T101) verschliessen, abschneiden", "ru": "<div n=\"1\">— 3) закрывать, отрезать: {#pratibaDnAti hi SreyaH pUjyapUjAvyatikramaH#}\n<ls>RAGH. 1,79.</ls> {#asya svargaprAptiranena duzkftena pratibaDyate#}\n<ls>KULL.</ls> к <ls>M. 9,254.</ls> {#pratibadDaprasara#}\n<ls>MALLIN.</ls> к <ls>KUMĀRAS. 3,12.</ls>", "de": "<div n=\"1\">— 3) {%verschliessen, abschneiden%}: {#pratibaDnAti hi SreyaH pUjyapUjAvyatikramaH#}\n<ls>RAGH. 1,79.</ls> {#asya svargaprAptiranena duzkftena pratibaDyate#}\n<ls>KULL.</ls> zu <ls>M. 9,254.</ls> {#pratibadDaprasara#}\n<ls>MALLIN.</ls> zu <ls>KUMĀRAS. 3,12.</ls>", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "", "differentia": "verschliessen = закрывать, запирать (перекрывать доступ); abschneiden = отрезать, отсекать (разделять)", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "banD", "safe_root": "ban_d", "rootmap_sha256": "d0c355736e7b7bc1d51234a3f5481d81b293e9a8b38d893ac6f52899ff5e16c7", "input_raw_sha256": "28c73e7d98745d0d0feee7dd08f7476e56e957cb1fddd911aaa37033ccdda475", "input_portrait_sha256": "21a738914936291635a38ed4d4b57a76dbe7ed797410b564177720b4a7ef6fba", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:37:40Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.banD.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
