{"key1": "brU", "subcard": "br_u~~h0_zz_nws00", "iast": "brū", "h": "brū", "sense_tag": "NWS:9", "ru": "{#+ a : to fail to testify (on the part of a witness); to refuse to speak in court (on the part of ligitants). MānDhŚ 8.13 .#} + adhi: говорить в пользу кого-л. (Dat.), защищать, брать под защиту, принимать чью-л. сторону, признавать правым. ṚV 1,35,11.", "de": "{#+ a : to fail to testify (on the part of a witness); to refuse to speak in court (on the part of ligitants). MānDhŚ 8.13 .#} [Śā , Soc (s.v. a √ brū )] + adhi : zugunsten von jemandem (Dat) sprechen, verteidigen, in Schutz nehmen, Partei nehmen für, Recht geben. ṚV 1,35,11 . Ved , unsp", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Vedic", "differentia": "Geldner (s.v. a √ brū): приставка adhi смещает значение от 'говорить' к 'защищать/поддерживать'.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "brU", "safe_root": "br_u", "rootmap_sha256": "e3a5775e275129b6472df8ac2edf0e3c1b82b0dbb1012403d9be4395e6160fdc", "input_raw_sha256": "962bc3c50ba68da7f26b3e35bb597bdeeb971eb81b224c3cdcf54335610277eb", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:37:52Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.brU.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "brU", "subcard": "br_u~~h0_zz_nws00", "iast": "brū", "h": "brū", "sense_tag": "NWS:10", "ru": "{#– fürsprechen, fürbitten. ṚV 10,15,5 .#} + ádhi: обращаться к кому-л. (Dat.) с утешением или ободрением.", "de": "{#– fürsprechen, fürbitten. ṚV 10,15,5 .#} [Ved , unsp] + ádhi : jemandem (Dat) tröstend oder ermunternd zusprechen. Ved , unsp", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Vedic", "differentia": "Graßmann (adhi): тональный оттенок — 'ободрять/утешать' в отличие от нейтрального 'защищать' у Geldner.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "brU", "safe_root": "br_u", "rootmap_sha256": "e3a5775e275129b6472df8ac2edf0e3c1b82b0dbb1012403d9be4395e6160fdc", "input_raw_sha256": "962bc3c50ba68da7f26b3e35bb597bdeeb971eb81b224c3cdcf54335610277eb", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:37:52Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.brU.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "brU", "subcard": "br_u~~h0_zz_nws00", "iast": "brū", "h": "brū", "sense_tag": "NWS:11", "ru": "{#– ( ádhi brūhi naḥ ): bless us. ṚV I,114,10 .#} + ánu: говорить по памяти, воспроизводить устно.", "de": "{#– ( ádhi brūhi naḥ ): bless us. ṚV I,114,10 .#} [Ved , unsp] + ánu : nach der Erinnerung sprechen. Ved , unsp", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Vedic", "differentia": "Graßmann (anu): приставка anu указывает на следование образцу — 'повторять/произносить по памяти'.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "brU", "safe_root": "br_u", "rootmap_sha256": "e3a5775e275129b6472df8ac2edf0e3c1b82b0dbb1012403d9be4395e6160fdc", "input_raw_sha256": "962bc3c50ba68da7f26b3e35bb597bdeeb971eb81b224c3cdcf54335610277eb", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:37:52Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.brU.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "brU", "subcard": "br_u~~h0_zz_nws00", "iast": "brū", "h": "brū", "sense_tag": "NWS:12", "ru": "{#+ ava : tadeln, siehe anavabravá .#} + upa: обращаться к (кому-л.), просить о (+ 2 Akk.); увещевать, ободрять. ṚV 4,51,11, ṚV 1,134,2.", "de": "{#+ ava : tadeln, siehe anavabravá .#} [Ved , unsp] + upa : ansprechen, bitten um (+ 2 Akk); zureden, ermuntern. ṚV 4,51,11 , ṚV 1,134,2 . Ved , unsp", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Vedic", "differentia": "Geldner (upa): два значения — 'просить' (с двойным Akk.) и 'увещевать' — объединены приставкой upa.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "brU", "safe_root": "br_u", "rootmap_sha256": "e3a5775e275129b6472df8ac2edf0e3c1b82b0dbb1012403d9be4395e6160fdc", "input_raw_sha256": "962bc3c50ba68da7f26b3e35bb597bdeeb971eb81b224c3cdcf54335610277eb", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:37:52Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.brU.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "brU", "subcard": "br_u~~h0_zz_nws00", "iast": "brū", "h": "brū", "sense_tag": "NWS:13", "ru": "{#– bittend ansprechen, anrufen, appellieren an. ṚV 10,35,7 .#} + úpa: 1) взывать к кому-л. (Akk.); 2) называть кого-л. (так-то), с двойным Akk. или, при 2-м лице, с Voc. вместо второго Akk.; 3) побуждать кого-л. (Akk.) к чему-л. (Dat.); 4) просить кого-л. (Akk.) о чём-л. (Akk.).", "de": "{#– bittend ansprechen, anrufen, appellieren an. ṚV 10,35,7 .#} [Ved , unsp] + úpa : 1) jemand (Akk) anrufen; 2) jemand anrufen als, mit dopp. Akk oder bei der zweiten Pers auch mit dem Vok statt des zweiten Akk; 3) jemand (Akk) auffordern zu (Dat); 4) jemand (Akk) bitten um (Akk). Ved , unsp", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Vedic", "differentia": "Graßmann (upa): четыре подзначения — 'взывать', 'называть', 'побуждать', 'просить' — вскрываемые синтаксическим управлением.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "brU", "safe_root": "br_u", "rootmap_sha256": "e3a5775e275129b6472df8ac2edf0e3c1b82b0dbb1012403d9be4395e6160fdc", "input_raw_sha256": "962bc3c50ba68da7f26b3e35bb597bdeeb971eb81b224c3cdcf54335610277eb", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:37:52Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.brU.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
