{"key1": "brU", "subcard": "br_u~~h0_zz_nws00", "iast": "brū", "h": "brū", "sense_tag": "NWS:15", "ru": "{#+ pra : a) to say, tell, relate (with satyam : to speak the truth, speak sincerely); b) to read before (gen or dat); c) to call, name; d) to describe as (two acc). BṛhSaṃ , BhāgP , Mbh .#} — сообщать, разглашать.", "de": "{#+ pra : a) to say, tell, relate (with satyam : to speak the truth, speak sincerely); b) to read before (gen or dat); c) to call, name; d) to describe as (two acc). BṛhSaṃ , BhāgP , Mbh .#} [Gen , unsp (s.v. prabrū )] – mittheilen, verrathen. Ved , unsp", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Vedic", "differentia": "Windisch (s.v. prabrū): pra- смещает значение к 'сообщать / выдавать тайну'.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "brU", "safe_root": "br_u", "rootmap_sha256": "e3a5775e275129b6472df8ac2edf0e3c1b82b0dbb1012403d9be4395e6160fdc", "input_raw_sha256": "962bc3c50ba68da7f26b3e35bb597bdeeb971eb81b224c3cdcf54335610277eb", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:37:52Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.brU.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "brU", "subcard": "br_u~~h0_zz_nws00", "iast": "brū", "h": "brū", "sense_tag": "NWS:16", "ru": "{#– verkünden, aussprechen, ansagen; rühmen, sich rühmen mit (Akk). ṚV 10,52,1 , ṚV 10,54,2 .#} — a) отвечать на обвинение (со стороны ответчика); b) (с anyathā) давать ложные показания, влекущие проигрыш дела. MānDhŚ 8.58, NārSm Mā 1.60.", "de": "{#– verkünden, aussprechen, ansagen; rühmen, sich rühmen mit (Akk). ṚV 10,52,1 , ṚV 10,54,2 .#} [Ved , unsp] – a) to respond to a charge (on the part of the defendant); b) (with anyathā ) to give false testimony causing the loss of suit. MānDhŚ 8.58 , NārSm Mā 1.60 . Śā , Soc ; Olivelle 2015 : 281 (s.v. pra √ brū )", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Classical", "differentia": "Olivelle (s.v. pra √ brū): два юридических подзначения — a) ответная сторона в суде; b) лжесвидетельство.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "brU", "safe_root": "br_u", "rootmap_sha256": "e3a5775e275129b6472df8ac2edf0e3c1b82b0dbb1012403d9be4395e6160fdc", "input_raw_sha256": "962bc3c50ba68da7f26b3e35bb597bdeeb971eb81b224c3cdcf54335610277eb", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:37:52Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.brU.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "brU", "subcard": "br_u~~h0_zz_nws00", "iast": "brū", "h": "brū", "sense_tag": "NWS:17", "ru": "{#+ prá : 1) jemandem (Dat) etwas (Akk) verkünden oder rühmend nennen, anpreisen (auch ohne Dat und mit indirecter Rede statt des Akk); 2) preisend aussprechen, preisen (Akk); 3) med: etwas (Akk) an sich kund werden lassen, offenbaren; 4) jemand (Dat) segnen (Gegensatz śap ).#} — (prá bruváte): возвещают, провозглашают. ṚV V,87,2.", "de": "{#+ prá : 1) jemandem (Dat) etwas (Akk) verkünden oder rühmend nennen, anpreisen (auch ohne Dat und mit indirecter Rede statt des Akk); 2) preisend aussprechen, preisen (Akk); 3) med: etwas (Akk) an sich kund werden lassen, offenbaren; 4) jemand (Dat) segnen (Gegensatz śap ).#} [Ved , unsp] – ( prá bruváte ): they proclaim. ṚV V,87,2 . Ved , unsp", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Vedic", "differentia": "Vedic Hymns I (pra-): оттенок 'публичного провозглашения' в отличие от нейтрального 'сообщать'.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "brU", "safe_root": "br_u", "rootmap_sha256": "e3a5775e275129b6472df8ac2edf0e3c1b82b0dbb1012403d9be4395e6160fdc", "input_raw_sha256": "962bc3c50ba68da7f26b3e35bb597bdeeb971eb81b224c3cdcf54335610277eb", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:37:52Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.brU.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
