{"key1": "brU", "subcard": "br_u~~h0_zz_nws00", "iast": "brū", "h": "brū", "sense_tag": "NWS:21", "ru": "{#+ ví : 1) jemandem (Dat) etwas (Akk) aussprechen, verkünden; 2) med: sich streiten.#} + sám: 1) совещаться, беседовать друг с другом; объединяться.", "de": "{#+ ví : 1) jemandem (Dat) etwas (Akk) aussprechen, verkünden; 2) med: sich streiten.#} [Ved , unsp] + sám : 1) sich besprechen, sich einander zugesellen. Ved , unsp", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Vedic", "differentia": "Graßmann (sam): взаимное действие — 'совещаться / соединяться'.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "brU", "safe_root": "br_u", "rootmap_sha256": "e3a5775e275129b6472df8ac2edf0e3c1b82b0dbb1012403d9be4395e6160fdc", "input_raw_sha256": "962bc3c50ba68da7f26b3e35bb597bdeeb971eb81b224c3cdcf54335610277eb", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:37:52Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.brU.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
