{"key1": "gA", "subcard": "g_a~~h0_zz_nws01", "iast": "gā", "h": "gā", "sense_tag": "NWS:37", "ru": "{#+ ava (° gīta , ppp.): (lit. sung down), reduced, diminished. JKM(Ā) 11.21 .#} [Buddh , unsp (s.v. avagīta )] + ava ( avagīta ): a) воспетый пренебрежительно; b) часто воспеваемый, общеизвестный, избитый; c) порицаемый, достойный осуждения, презренный, низкий. Gen , unsp ; MW : 97 (s.v. avagīta )", "de": "{#+ ava (° gīta , ppp.): (lit. sung down), reduced, diminished. JKM(Ā) 11.21 .#} [Buddh , unsp (s.v. avagīta )] + ava ( avagīta ): a) sung depreciatingly; b) sung of frequently, well known, trite; c) censured, blamable, despicable, vile. Gen , unsp ; MW : 97 (s.v. avagīta )", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Classical", "differentia": "MW: ava + gai → три значения pp. avagīta: пренебрежительное воспевание, тривиальность, порицание.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "gA", "safe_root": "g_a", "rootmap_sha256": "ef4503f729d2357d1e90500f51727e2c3435b33b236b3d9afe4eb529eb10f691", "input_raw_sha256": "3ed1e23d925e5363f7b61189c8be25e5d809ad84a7539efaa84ad4663190c641", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-30T04:05:28Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.gA.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
