{"key1": "gA", "subcard": "g_a~~h0_zz_nws01", "iast": "gā", "h": "gā", "sense_tag": "NWS:42", "ru": "{#– „sing“.#} [Ved , unsp (s.v. vigā -)] – ( vigīta ): „ pṛthag gītaḥ \"; частично воспетый. ṢB II.3.11 , ĀpŚS XIII.15.9 . Ved , unsp ; Renou 1935 : 26 (s.v. vigīta )", "de": "{#– „sing“.#} [Ved , unsp (s.v. vigā -)] – ( vigīta ): „ pṛthag gītaḥ \"; partly sung. ṢB II.3.11 , ĀpŚS XIII.15.9 . Ved , unsp ; Renou 1935 : 26 (s.v. vigīta )", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Vedic", "differentia": "Renou: pp. vigīta — «пропетый раздельно»; техническое значение ритуального пения.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "gA", "safe_root": "g_a", "rootmap_sha256": "ef4503f729d2357d1e90500f51727e2c3435b33b236b3d9afe4eb529eb10f691", "input_raw_sha256": "3ed1e23d925e5363f7b61189c8be25e5d809ad84a7539efaa84ad4663190c641", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-30T04:05:28Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.gA.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "gA", "subcard": "g_a~~h0_zz_nws01", "iast": "gā", "h": "gā", "sense_tag": "NWS:43", "ru": "{#+ sam (° gāyati ): lit. ‘sings in unison’ = is concordant, avoids quarreling [opp. of vivadati ]. KPar 142.4 .#} [Buddh , unsp (s.v. saṃgāyati )] – ( saṃgīta ): a) воспетый хором (?); b) соответствующий, согласующийся. STB, S. 93, Z. 20 , Is Indon 1, 11 . Reg , unsp ; Ensink 1964 : 193 (s.v. saṃgīta )", "de": "{#+ sam (° gāyati ): lit. ‘sings in unison’ = is concordant, avoids quarreling [opp. of vivadati ]. KPar 142.4 .#} [Buddh , unsp (s.v. saṃgāyati )] – ( saṃgīta ): a) sung in chorus (?); b) corresponding, harmonizing. STB, S. 93, Z. 20 , Is Indon 1, 11 . Reg , unsp ; Ensink 1964 : 193 (s.v. saṃgīta )", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Classical", "differentia": "Ensink: буддийско-региональный источник; pp. saṃgīta — хоровое пение и гармония.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "gA", "safe_root": "g_a", "rootmap_sha256": "ef4503f729d2357d1e90500f51727e2c3435b33b236b3d9afe4eb529eb10f691", "input_raw_sha256": "3ed1e23d925e5363f7b61189c8be25e5d809ad84a7539efaa84ad4663190c641", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-30T04:05:28Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.gA.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
