{"key1": "jIv", "subcard": "j_iv~~h0_zz_nws00", "iast": "jīv", "h": "jīv", "sense_tag": "NWS-4", "ru": "{#+ pratyud ( pratyujjīvyate ): resuscitates (said fig. of a suffix which had been abolished by a previous rule). DurghVṛ 1.2,48 .#} [Śā , Ling (s.v. jīv)] jīvamāna Śā , Ling > привыкший жить, живущий (о деятеле, для которого жизнедеятельность является привычным состоянием). BhāṣāVṛ 3.2,129. [NWS: Renou 1953 (1) : 11 (s.v. jīv)]", "de": "{#+ pratyud ( pratyujjīvyate ): resuscitates (said fig. of a suffix which had been abolished by a previous rule). DurghVṛ 1.2,48 .#} [Śā , Ling (s.v. jīv )] jīvamāna Śā , Ling > habituated to live. BhāṣāVṛ 3.2,129 . Renou 1953 (1) : 11 (s.v. jīv )", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Classical", "differentia": "Грамматическая глосса Реную касается формы jīvamāna как примера настояще-причастного значения «привычного» действия (Śākaṭāyana / лингвистич. контекст).", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "jIv", "safe_root": "j_iv", "rootmap_sha256": "8602cae1d0b1971a49723b9b2c231cd851018c46c9543cce87ead4d8531c1668", "input_raw_sha256": "669e9ba0d2cfdb285e2871ccf380b53d2cf13e60ab347777044440bd705ab8f8", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:37:52Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.jIv.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
