{"key1": "man", "subcard": "man~~h0_17_prati", "iast": "man", "h": "man (prati+man)", "sense_tag": "1", "ru": "<div n=\"p\">— {#prati#} отвечать, возражать кому-л. (<ab>acc.</ab>) что-л. (<ab>acc.</ab>): {#e\\tattvAtra^ pratimanvA\\no a^smi#}\n<ls>VS. 23,52.</ls> {#tadu ha SOnakaH kApeyaH pratimanvAnaH (= manasAlocayan#}\n<ls>ŚAṂK.</ls>) {#pratyeyAya#}", "de": "<div n=\"p\">— {#prati#} {%erwiedern, Jmd%} (<ab>acc.</ab>) {%Etwas%} (<ab>acc.</ab>) {%entgegenhalten%}: {#e\\tattvAtra^ pratimanvA\\no a^smi#}\n<ls>VS. 23,52.</ls> {#tadu ha SOnakaH kApeyaH pratimanvAnaH (= manasAlocayan#}\n<ls>ŚAṂK.</ls>) {#pratyeyAya#}", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "", "differentia": "erwiedern = отвечать; entgegenhalten = выдвигать возражение, противопоставлять — семантика встречного высказывания.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "man", "safe_root": "man", "rootmap_sha256": "7198637ce96ad555fc84710137ba7bfd58a18cac341d2bd00671bad5b2148cb3", "input_raw_sha256": "26382410cc236a41079cd9de0d8aa90fc404c338706582bb4eddbeb39b7d580f", "input_portrait_sha256": "615eca3b16f85b5ec3947d75c6c68087746c730ebaafa099a83c35b45ed8d596", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:37:39Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.man.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "man", "subcard": "man~~h0_17_prati", "iast": "man", "h": "man (prati+man)", "sense_tag": "2", "ru": "<ls>CHĀND. UP. 4,3,7.</ls> — <ab>caus.</ab> чтить кого-л.: {#pratimAnya DanaMjayam#}\n<ls>MBH. 3,1712.</ls>\n<ls>R. 3,53,27.</ls>\n<ls>Spr. 2230.</ls>\n<ls>KĀM. NĪTIS. 17,31.</ls> <ab>Inschr.</ab> в\n<ls>Journ. of the Am. Or. S. 6,543,10.</ls> держать что-л. в почёте", "de": "<ls>CHĀND. UP. 4,3,7.</ls> — <ab>caus.</ab> {%Jmd ehren%}: {#pratimAnya DanaMjayam#}\n<ls>MBH. 3,1712.</ls>\n<ls>R. 3,53,27.</ls>\n<ls>Spr. 2230.</ls>\n<ls>KĀM. NĪTIS. 17,31.</ls> <ab>Inschr.</ab> in\n<ls>Journ. of the Am. Or. S. 6,543,10.</ls> {%Etwas in Ehren halten%}", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "", "differentia": "ehren = чтить, почитать — уважительное отношение к лицу; Etwas in Ehren halten = держать что-л. в почёте.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "man", "safe_root": "man", "rootmap_sha256": "7198637ce96ad555fc84710137ba7bfd58a18cac341d2bd00671bad5b2148cb3", "input_raw_sha256": "26382410cc236a41079cd9de0d8aa90fc404c338706582bb4eddbeb39b7d580f", "input_portrait_sha256": "615eca3b16f85b5ec3947d75c6c68087746c730ebaafa099a83c35b45ed8d596", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:37:39Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.man.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "man", "subcard": "man~~h0_17_prati", "iast": "man", "h": "man (prati+man)", "sense_tag": "3", "ru": "<ls>VARĀH. BṚH. S. 50,6.</ls> благосклонно принять, встречать одобрением: {#pUrvaM tu bAlAH samudAharanti (samudAvahanti#} более новая <ab>Ausg.</ab>) {#. vfdDASca paScAtpratimAnayanti sTAnezu nityaM pratimAnayanti ..#}\n<ls>HARIV. 8467.</ls> {#prIyamARo halaDaraH saMbanDaM pratimAnayan#}\n<ls>MBH. 1,8015.</ls> {#tatpratimAnyatAM praTamaH suhftpraRayaH#}", "de": "<ls>VARĀH. BṚH. S. 50,6.</ls> {%gut —, mit Beifall aufnehmen%}: {#pUrvaM tu bAlAH samudAharanti (samudAvahanti#} die neuere <ab>Ausg.</ab>) {#. vfdDASca paScAtpratimAnayanti sTAnezu nityaM pratimAnayanti ..#}\n<ls>HARIV. 8467.</ls> {#prIyamARo halaDaraH saMbanDaM pratimAnayan#}\n<ls>MBH. 1,8015.</ls> {#tatpratimAnyatAM praTamaH suhftpraRayaH#}", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "", "differentia": "gut aufnehmen = принять благосклонно; mit Beifall aufnehmen = встретить с одобрением — позитивная рецепция.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "man", "safe_root": "man", "rootmap_sha256": "7198637ce96ad555fc84710137ba7bfd58a18cac341d2bd00671bad5b2148cb3", "input_raw_sha256": "26382410cc236a41079cd9de0d8aa90fc404c338706582bb4eddbeb39b7d580f", "input_portrait_sha256": "615eca3b16f85b5ec3947d75c6c68087746c730ebaafa099a83c35b45ed8d596", "generated_at": "2026-06-29T12:37:39Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.man.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
