{"key1": "yat", "subcard": "yat~~h0_zz_nws00", "iast": "yat", "h": "yat", "sense_tag": "NWS-25", "ru": "[NWS:] {#ya#} [yat khalu или yaṃ khalu] с формой 2-го (или вежливого 3-го) лица jñā (обычно opt.): примите к сведению; позвольте вас уведомить. [вежливое введение к высказыванию, обращённому обычно к царю или подобному лицу. Mvu ii.454.1.] BHSD : 442 (s.v. yat khalu)", "de": "{#ya#} [Buddh , unsp] [ yat khalu , or yaṃ khalu ] with a 2d (or polite 3d) person form of jñā (regularly opt.): please be informed; allow me to inform you. [ a courteous introduction to a statement made usually to a king or the like. Mvu ii.454.1 . ] BHSD : 442 (s.v. yat khalu )", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": "Buddhist", "differentia": "", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "yat", "safe_root": "yat", "rootmap_sha256": "de16735d872827f0a59d8bdc9e077bd676ab8356a150e5c95efb37dec747441f", "input_raw_sha256": "da0bae351790603a826ea95ab3112a4841ca0cfe817c3ba3697961ed1fed1bdb", "input_portrait_sha256": "4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945", "generated_at": "2026-06-30T05:05:12Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.sc.yat.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
