{"key1": "SrI", "subcard": "_sr_i", "iast": "śrī", "h": "1 (Nachträge #2)", "sense_tag": "3", "ru": "3. {#SrI#}¦ (= 2. или же 1. {#SrI#}) прил. <lex>adj.</lex> <ab>s.</ab> {#kzIra˚, Gfta˚, saktu˚#} .", "de": "3. {#SrI#}¦ (= 2. oder auch 1. {#SrI#}) <lex>adj.</lex> <ab>s.</ab> {#kzIra˚, Gfta˚, saktu˚#} .", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": null, "differentia": "Отглагольное прилагательное, возводимое либо к śrī 2 «смешанный», либо к śrī 1 «сваренный».", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "SrI", "safe_root": "_sr_i", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4736683602f9582fb347635519d30e85c7f47f62cc827f3127e50225aeaeff45", "input_portrait_sha256": "8b8f650755d3eb9b9f991593e89f6c642022063edfa351fc0002ecf4af43f508", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:26:46Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.SrI.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
