{"key1": "SrI", "subcard": "_sr_i", "iast": "śrī", "h": "NWS #14", "sense_tag": "NWS-14", "ru": "[Śā, Soc] сущ. ж.р. «удача, царственность, представленная как жена царя». MānDhŚ 9.300 [NWS: Olivelle 2015 : 389]", "de": "[Śā , Soc] Subst f fortune, sovereignty viewed as the wife of a king. MānDhŚ 9.300 [NWS: Olivelle 2015 : 389]", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": null, "differentia": null, "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "SrI", "safe_root": "_sr_i", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4736683602f9582fb347635519d30e85c7f47f62cc827f3127e50225aeaeff45", "input_portrait_sha256": "8b8f650755d3eb9b9f991593e89f6c642022063edfa351fc0002ecf4af43f508", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:26:46Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.SrI.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "SrI", "subcard": "_sr_i", "iast": "śrī", "h": "NWS #15", "sense_tag": "NWS-15", "ru": "[Buddh, неопр.] [Ś(i)rī] «имя девакумарики в северной стороне». Mvu iii.309.9. «имя одного из 8 божеств дерева Бодхи». Lal 331.21. «имя матери Будды Мангалы». Mvu i.249.17. «имя дочери брахмана в 'джатаке Шири'». Mvu ii.89.19 и далее. «в качестве почётного добавления в конце личных имён, тогда как в санскрите — только в начале; отмечено только в Mvu». Mvu i.62.10 [NWS: BHSD : 535]", "de": "[Buddh , unsp] [Ś(i)rī] n. of a devakumārikā in the northern quarter. Mvu iii.309.9 . n. of one of the 8 deities of the Bodhi-tree. Lal 331.21 . n. of the mother of the Buddha Maṅgala. Mvu i.249.17 . n. of a brahman's daughter, in the 'Śiri-jātaka'. Mvu ii.89.19 ff . honorifically added at the end of proper names, as in Skt. only at the beginning; noted only in Mvu. Mvu i.62.10 [NWS: BHSD : 535]", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": null, "differentia": null, "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "SrI", "safe_root": "_sr_i", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4736683602f9582fb347635519d30e85c7f47f62cc827f3127e50225aeaeff45", "input_portrait_sha256": "8b8f650755d3eb9b9f991593e89f6c642022063edfa351fc0002ecf4af43f508", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:26:46Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.SrI.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "SrI", "subcard": "_sr_i", "iast": "śrī", "h": "NWS #16", "sense_tag": "NWS-16", "ru": "[Jin, неопр., 2-я пол. XII в., Гуджарат] сущ. ж.р. «освобождение». TriṣaŚaPuC 1.19.25. «слава, в высокой степени персонифицированная». TriṣaŚaPuC 1.2.363. līlā, «явление, подобие». TriṣaŚaPuC 1.5.579 [NWS: TŚPC 1 : 475]", "de": "[Jin , unsp , 2. H. 12. Jh. , Gujarat] Subst f emancipation. TriṣaŚaPuC 1. 19. 25 . glory, highly personified. TriṣaŚaPuC 1. 2. 363 . līlā , appearance, resemblance. TriṣaŚaPuC 1. 5. 579 [NWS: TŚPC 1 : 475]", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": null, "differentia": null, "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "SrI", "safe_root": "_sr_i", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4736683602f9582fb347635519d30e85c7f47f62cc827f3127e50225aeaeff45", "input_portrait_sha256": "8b8f650755d3eb9b9f991593e89f6c642022063edfa351fc0002ecf4af43f508", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:26:46Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.SrI.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "SrI", "subcard": "_sr_i", "iast": "śrī", "h": "NWS #17", "sense_tag": "NWS-17", "ru": "[Epigr, неопр.] «почётная приставка к именам, по-разному передаваемая в английском; напр. для верховных государей и их жён — 'славный'; для вассалов и прочих обычных лиц — 'знаменитый'; для жрецов, учителей и т.п. — 'святой'; для богов — 'священный'. CII 3 (указатель). иногда śrī употребляется перед согласными, а śrīmat перед гласными. śrī иногда повторяется для усиления, напр. 'śrī 108' пишется для обозначения повторения слова 108 раз. IA 17 (указатель)» [NWS: Sircar 1966 : 317]", "de": "[Epigr , unsp] honorific prefix to names often rendered variously in English; e.g. in the case of paramount sovereigns and their wives by „glorious“; of feudatories and other ordinary persons by „illustrious“; of priests, teachers, etc., by „saintly“; of gods by „holy“. CII 3 (Index) . sometimes śrī is used before consonants and śrīmat before vowels. śrī is sometimes repeated for emphasis, e.g., „ śrī 108“ is written to indicate the repetition of the word for 108 times. IA 17 (Index) [NWS: Sircar 1966 : 317]", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": null, "differentia": null, "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "SrI", "safe_root": "_sr_i", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4736683602f9582fb347635519d30e85c7f47f62cc827f3127e50225aeaeff45", "input_portrait_sha256": "8b8f650755d3eb9b9f991593e89f6c642022063edfa351fc0002ecf4af43f508", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:26:46Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.SrI.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "SrI", "subcard": "_sr_i", "iast": "śrī", "h": "NWS #18", "sense_tag": "NWS-18", "ru": "{#śrā (=pw śrā 1)#} [Ved, неопр.] «варить». ṚV I,68,1. śiśrītá: «он созрел/дозрел». ṚV I,149,2. śrīṇīṣe: «ты греешь/варишь». ṚV V,6,9 [NWS: Vedic Hymns II : 476 (s.v. śrī)]", "de": "{#śrā (=pw śrā 1)#} [Ved , unsp] to cook. ṚV I,68,1 . śiśrītá : he has ripened. ṚV I,149,2 . śrīṇīṣe : thou warmest. ṚV V,6,9 [NWS: Vedic Hymns II : 476 (s.v. śrī)]", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": null, "differentia": null, "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "SrI", "safe_root": "_sr_i", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4736683602f9582fb347635519d30e85c7f47f62cc827f3127e50225aeaeff45", "input_portrait_sha256": "8b8f650755d3eb9b9f991593e89f6c642022063edfa351fc0002ecf4af43f508", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:26:46Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.SrI.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
