{"key1": "SrI", "subcard": "_sr_i", "iast": "śrī", "h": "NWS #21", "sense_tag": "NWS-21", "ru": "{#śrīdhara#} [Gen, неопр.] сущ. м.р. «имя седьмого архата прошлой Утсарпини». Lex(MW). (также с ācārya, kavi, dīkṣita, bhaṭṭa, miśra и т.д.) «имя различных авторов и других лиц». SDS, Buddh(MW). MW : 1099 (s.v. śrī) [NWS: MW : 1099 (s.v. śrī)]", "de": "{#śrīdhara#} [Gen , unsp] Subst m N of the seventh Arhat of the past Utsarpiṇī. Lex(MW) . (also with ācārya , kavi , dīkṣita , bhaṭṭa , miśra &) N of various authors and other men. SDS , Buddh(MW) . MW : 1099 (s.v. śrī) [NWS: MW : 1099 (s.v. śrī)]", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": null, "differentia": null, "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "SrI", "safe_root": "_sr_i", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4736683602f9582fb347635519d30e85c7f47f62cc827f3127e50225aeaeff45", "input_portrait_sha256": "8b8f650755d3eb9b9f991593e89f6c642022063edfa351fc0002ecf4af43f508", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:26:46Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.SrI.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
