{"key1": "kAla", "subcard": "k_ala", "iast": "kāla", "h": "NWS", "sense_tag": "nws-30", "ru": "[NWS: MW : 278 (s.v. kālá)] [Gen , unsp] {#kālacakra#} Субст. ср. р. данный оборот времени, цикл [по учению джайнов, колесо времени имеет двенадцать спиц (Ara) и совершает один оборот за 2000000000000000 sāgara лет]. колесо фортуны (иногда рассматриваемое как оружие). R . . MW : 278 (s.v. kālá)", "de": "[NWS: MW : 278 (s.v. kālá)] [Gen , unsp] {#kālacakra#} Subst n a given revolution of time, cycle [according to the Jainas, the wheel of time has twelve Aras or spokes and turns round once in 2000000000000000 Sāgaras of years]. the wheel of fortune (sometimes regarded as a weapon). R . . MW : 278 (s.v. kālá)", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "lexicographic", "stratum": null, "differentia": null, "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "kAla", "safe_root": "k_ala", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "3c7952f3c70d377077ca53afbdcffdc2a4ba8d1fd895f35998d925e09265c96b", "input_portrait_sha256": "14d0cb73c807ae237befb66e4c533ce07c5ba571d09ba4ba423ba0be99f3ff30", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:59:35Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.kAla.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
