{"key1": "ka", "subcard": "ka", "iast": null, "h": null, "sense_tag": "SCH-add-1", "ru": "1. {%ka%} ¦ с {%cid%} и {%cana%}. Примечательно сочетание {%na te kaścid Daśarathas tvaṃ ca tasya na kaścana%}, то есть примерно «{%ты%} и {%Дашаратха%} не имеют друг с другом ничего общего», <ls>R. 2,108,10.</ls>", "de": "1. {%ka%}¦ mit {%cid%} und {%cana%}. Bemerkenswert ist die Verbindung {%na te kaścid Daśarathas tvaṃ ca tasya na kaścana%} so v.a. {%du%} und {%Daśaratha%} haben nichts miteinander zu tun, <ls>R. 2,108,10.</ls>", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": null, "differentia": "SCH Nachträge patch to PW sense 1: supplies the concrete Sanskrit citation for the idiom noted in PW; render as a proverbial phrase of mutual unrelatedness.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "ka", "safe_root": "ka", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4112a8007d8743f428199660a5b130c3bb20715e15e994b13c34e7b54e140d4f", "input_portrait_sha256": "a570bbf74b5521290cd32082f525f0165dfa779ff1bde6bee8f27e9d14ac1709", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:31:31Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.ka.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "ka", "subcard": "ka", "iast": null, "h": null, "sense_tag": "SCH-add-2a", "ru": "{%ka%} ¦ m. = *Яма, <ls>Rasas. 4</ls><sup>a</sup> (в {%kapālin = kād Yamān mṛtyoḥ pālayatīti mṛtyuṃjayaḥ%}).", "de": "{%ka%}¦ m. = *Yama, <ls>Rasas. 4</ls><sup>a</sup> (in {%kapālin = kād Yamān mṛtyoḥ pālayatīti mṛtyuṃjayaḥ%}).", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "lexicographic", "stratum": null, "differentia": "First-attestation (*) gloss equating ka with the god Yama, drawn from an etymological word-play (nirvacana) in a commentarial gloss, not a text citation.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "ka", "safe_root": "ka", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4112a8007d8743f428199660a5b130c3bb20715e15e994b13c34e7b54e140d4f", "input_portrait_sha256": "a570bbf74b5521290cd32082f525f0165dfa779ff1bde6bee8f27e9d14ac1709", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:31:31Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.ka.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "ka", "subcard": "ka", "iast": null, "h": null, "sense_tag": "SCH-add-2b", "ru": "— = *ветер, там же (в {%kapālī = kaṃ vāyuṃ pibanti teṣāṃ kapānāṃ sarpāṇām ālī%}); <ls>S I,25,15</ls> см. ниже (Ko.: {%kena vāyunā dalyate vidīryate kadalī%}); 101,8 (Ko.).", "de": "— = *Wind, ibid. (in {%kapālī = kaṃ vāyuṃ pibanti teṣāṃ kapānāṃ sarpāṇām ālī%}); <ls>S I,25,15</ls> v.u. (Ko.: {%kena vāyunā dalyate vidīryate kadalī%}); 101,8 (Ko.).", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "lexicographic", "stratum": null, "differentia": "Second nirvacana-based gloss 'ka = wind', again from a kośa-style word-play (Ko. = Koṣa), lexicographic not textually attested.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "ka", "safe_root": "ka", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4112a8007d8743f428199660a5b130c3bb20715e15e994b13c34e7b54e140d4f", "input_portrait_sha256": "a570bbf74b5521290cd32082f525f0165dfa779ff1bde6bee8f27e9d14ac1709", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:31:31Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.ka.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "ka", "subcard": "ka", "iast": null, "h": null, "sense_tag": "SCH-add-2c", "ru": "— ˚волосы, <ls>Vās. 77,2.</ls> — вода, тоже <ls>Śrīk. 19,23.</ls> — голова, тоже <ls>Yudh. 4,69.</ls>", "de": "— ˚Haar, <ls>Vās. 77,2.</ls> — Wasser, auch <ls>Śrīk. 19,23.</ls> — Kopf, auch <ls>Yudh. 4,69.</ls>", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "lexicographic", "stratum": null, "differentia": "Compact list of further nirvacana-glosses appended to the same addendum entry: hair, water, head — each a distinct lexicographic sub-sense of ka.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "ka", "safe_root": "ka", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4112a8007d8743f428199660a5b130c3bb20715e15e994b13c34e7b54e140d4f", "input_portrait_sha256": "a570bbf74b5521290cd32082f525f0165dfa779ff1bde6bee8f27e9d14ac1709", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:31:31Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.ka.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "ka", "subcard": "ka", "iast": null, "h": null, "sense_tag": "PWKVN-1", "ru": "<hom>1.</hom> {#ka#} ¦ с {#cid#} и {#cana#} II. Примечательно сочетание {#na te kaSciddaSaraTastvaM [Page7-328-d] ca tasya na kaScana#}, так <ab>v. a.</ab> {%ты и%} <is>Daśaratha</is> {%не имеют друг с другом ничего общего%} <ls>R. 2,108,10</ls>.", "de": "<hom>1.</hom> {#ka#}¦ mit {#cid#} und {#cana#} II. Bemerkensworth ist die Verbindung {#na te kaSciddaSaraTastvaM [Page7-328-d] ca tasya na kaScana#} so <ab>v. a.</ab> {%du und%} <is>Daśaratha</is> {%haben Nichts mit einander zu thun%} <ls>R. 2,108,10</ls>.", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": null, "differentia": "PWKVN variant supplement duplicating PW sense 1 with its own placeholder set — same idiom, keyed to the same PW sense number.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "ka", "safe_root": "ka", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4112a8007d8743f428199660a5b130c3bb20715e15e994b13c34e7b54e140d4f", "input_portrait_sha256": "a570bbf74b5521290cd32082f525f0165dfa779ff1bde6bee8f27e9d14ac1709", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:31:31Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.ka.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "ka", "subcard": "ka", "iast": null, "h": null, "sense_tag": "NWS-1", "ru": "{#ká#} [Gen, unsp] Subst m имя царя. Lex(MW). n волосы, шевелюра. Lex(MW). MW : 240", "de": "{#ká#} [Gen, unsp] Subst m N of a king. Lex(MW). n hair, a head of hair. Lex(MW)", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "lexicographic", "stratum": null, "differentia": "Owner-map entry 1: purely lexicographic (Lex(MW)) senses — proper name of a king (m.) and 'hair, head of hair' (n.).", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "ka", "safe_root": "ka", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4112a8007d8743f428199660a5b130c3bb20715e15e994b13c34e7b54e140d4f", "input_portrait_sha256": "a570bbf74b5521290cd32082f525f0165dfa779ff1bde6bee8f27e9d14ac1709", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:31:31Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.ka.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "ka", "subcard": "ka", "iast": null, "h": null, "sense_tag": "NWS-2", "ru": "[Ved, unsp] Pr кто, который, вопросительное. как в субстантивном, так и в адъективном употреблении, часто также с последующим u, nú, svid (см. под этими словами). некто, кто-нибудь. после mā́. с последующим ca: a) кто-нибудь, какой-нибудь, b) в особенности после yá: какой бы ни. с caná: a) всякий, кто бы то ни был, b) особенно часто с предшествующим ná или mā́. с cid: a) некий, некто, нечто, Pl: некоторые, кое-какие; b) какой бы ни был, всякий, Pl: все, c) yás kás cid: какой бы ни", "de": "[Ved, unsp] Pr wer, welcher, fragend. sowol substantivisch als adjectivisch, oft auch mit folgendem u, nú, svid (s. unter diesen). irgendwer, jemand. nach mā́. mit folgendem ca: a) irgendwer, irgendwelcher, b) insbesondere nach yá: welcher irgend. mit caná: a) jeder, wer es auch sei, b) bes häufig mit vorangehendem ná oder mā́. mit cid: a) irgendein, ein, jemand, etwas, Pl: manche, irgendwelche; b) welcher es sei, jeder, Pl: alle, c) yás kás cid: welcher immer", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": null, "differentia": "Owner-map entry 2: the Vedic interrogative/indefinite pronoun ka in its full combinatorial paradigm (with u/nú/svid, ca, caná, cid) — rendered with the standard Russian correlative/indefinite constructions.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "ka", "safe_root": "ka", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4112a8007d8743f428199660a5b130c3bb20715e15e994b13c34e7b54e140d4f", "input_portrait_sha256": "a570bbf74b5521290cd32082f525f0165dfa779ff1bde6bee8f27e9d14ac1709", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:31:31Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.ka.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "ka", "subcard": "ka", "iast": null, "h": null, "sense_tag": "NWS-3", "ru": "[Ved, unsp] Pr [FPr] kím te: что с тобой случилось? ṚV I,165,3. kát ha nūnám: что же теперь? ṚV I,38,1. kát ártham: по какому делу? ṚV I,38,2. kát vocéma: что нам сказать? ṚV I,43,1. kím: почему? ṚV I,170,2. káḥ cit: кто-нибудь. ṚV I,37,13. ké cit: лишь немногие. ṚV I,87,1. kéna cít: что бы ни. ṚV I,87,2. Vedic Hymns I : 471 (s.v. kím)", "de": "[Ved, unsp] Pr [FPr] kím te: what has happened to thee? ṚV I,165,3. kát ha nūnám: what then now? ṚV I,38,1. kát ártham: what errand? ṚV I,38,2. kát vocéma: what could we say? ṚV I,43,1. kím: why? ṚV I,170,2. káḥ cit: any one. ṚV I,37,13. ké cit: a few only. ṚV I,87,1. kéna cít: whatever. ṚV I,87,2. Vedic Hymns I : 471 (s.v. kím)", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": null, "differentia": "Owner-map entry 3: ṚV-attested idiomatic phrases with kim/ka, glossed from Griffith's English Vedic Hymns I — each phrase translated individually with its citation.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "ka", "safe_root": "ka", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4112a8007d8743f428199660a5b130c3bb20715e15e994b13c34e7b54e140d4f", "input_portrait_sha256": "a570bbf74b5521290cd32082f525f0165dfa779ff1bde6bee8f27e9d14ac1709", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:31:31Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.ka.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
