{"key1": "ka", "subcard": "ka", "iast": null, "h": null, "sense_tag": "NWS-9", "ru": "[Ved, unsp] + api a) m: ko ’pi, f: kāpi: кто-нибудь, некто; b) na ko ’pi: никто; c) yaḥ ko ’pi: кто бы то ни было. TĀr(Sā) VI 10. 2 (7) к ṚV X 18, 4. Windisch 1883 : 116 (s.v. kimapi)", "de": "[Ved, unsp] + api a) m: ko ’pi, f: kāpi: irgendwer, einer; b) na ko ’pi: keiner; c) yaḥ ko ’pi: irgend einer. TĀr(Sā) VI 10. 2 (7) zu ṚV X 18, 4. Windisch 1883 : 116 (s.v. kimapi)", "equivalence_type": "equivalent", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": null, "differentia": "Owner-map entry 9: ka+api indefinite forms ko'pi/kāpi with negative and universal-relative variants.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "ka", "safe_root": "ka", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4112a8007d8743f428199660a5b130c3bb20715e15e994b13c34e7b54e140d4f", "input_portrait_sha256": "a570bbf74b5521290cd32082f525f0165dfa779ff1bde6bee8f27e9d14ac1709", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:31:31Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.ka.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
{"key1": "ka", "subcard": "ka", "iast": null, "h": null, "sense_tag": "NWS-10", "ru": "[Ved, unsp] Pr [FPr, n: kad и kim] кто?, что? kaś cit, kiṃ cit: кто-нибудь, что-нибудь. ŚB 4,1,5,5. na kecit: никакие. ṚV 7,103,8. na kaś cana, na kiṃ cana: никто, ничто. AV 5,19,10, ṚV 10,129,2. yat kiṃ ca: что бы ни. ṚV 5,83,9. yaḥ kaścit: кто бы ни. Hillebrandt 1885 : 81", "de": "[Ved, unsp] Pr [FPr, n: kad und kim] wer?, was? kaś cit, kiṃ cit: irgend wer, was. ŚB 4,1,5,5. na kecit: keine. ṚV 7,103,8. na kaś cana, na kiṃ cana: keiner, nichts. AV 5,19,10, ṚV 10,129,2. yat kiṃ ca: was immer. ṚV 5,83,9. yaḥ kaścit: wer immer. Hillebrandt 1885 : 81", "equivalence_type": "explanatory", "source_type": "attested", "stratum": null, "differentia": "Owner-map entry 10: further attested indefinite/negative constructions with ka(d)/kim across ŚB, ṚV, AV, from Hillebrandt's index.", "review_status": "ai_translated", "reviewer": null, "provenance": {"model": "sonnet", "generator": "gen_opt_harness2.batched-masked", "schema_version": "pwg_ru.workflow_meta.v1", "root": "ka", "safe_root": "ka", "rootmap_sha256": null, "input_raw_sha256": "4112a8007d8743f428199660a5b130c3bb20715e15e994b13c34e7b54e140d4f", "input_portrait_sha256": "a570bbf74b5521290cd32082f525f0165dfa779ff1bde6bee8f27e9d14ac1709", "generated_at": "2026-07-02T01:31:31Z", "wf_file": "wf_output.nom.ka.json", "promoted_by": "promote_final_cards.py"}}
